      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOM GUMP (6) goes very well this trip starting nine times for three wins and four minors. Comes off a (16.67) win last time, scoring by 1.3 lengths in a Grade 6 over 300m at this track. Has the ability and should feature. CRIMSON WARRIOR (2) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (19.30) at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with six wins and two minor placings from 12 starts. Better than last start and can bounce back. GOLDSTAR HECTOR (1) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (20.19). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from nine attempts. Has ability and can atone. LADY YOYO (3) was in the money last start at big odds - poses a threat again.",
